        <headline>Cancellation of Severe Thunderstorm Warning for North East Pastoral forecast district</headline>
        <description>
          
          
          This warning is now cancelled.
           
          
          91 km/h gust recorded at Marree Airport at 11:39pm CDT
          96 km/h gust recorded at Oodnadatta at 7:42 pm CDT
          98 km/h gust recorded at Port Augusta at 7:21 pm CDT
          96 km/h gust recorded at Cultana at 6:46 pm CDT
        </description>
        <instruction>The State Emergency Service advises that people should:
* Keep clear of fallen power lines.
* Beware of fallen trees or debris on the road.
* Don't drive, ride or walk through flood water.
* Keep clear of creeks and storm drains.

</instruction>
